      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm doing this project for school and honestly it's so annoying how all my history books just focus on europe and white people like they invented everything. it feels like they're skipping over everything else. can u help me find the actual real history of who really built the foundations of stuff like science and law? like, the parts that actually get left out of the mainstream western narrative?",
